{"snapshot_id": "cb8df7040351543262ead5637b910b0b2764be4d107818080faaf0af274f4da2", "doc": {"docs/architecture.md": {"status": "captured", "hash": "85edf0b16c089ed02b8e531d1e12bf2e2e25d15e3886fdcd0ea58b8ab937dbe3", "text_hash": "85edf0b16c089ed02b8e531d1e12bf2e2e25d15e3886fdcd0ea58b8ab937dbe3", "selected_lines": [{"line": 135, "text": "  InProgress -->|需要人工决定| WaitingHuman[Waiting Human]"}, {"line": 136, "text": "  Validating -->|需要人工决定| WaitingHuman"}, {"line": 137, "text": "  WaitingHuman --> Ready"}, {"line": 138, "text": "  InProgress --> Failed[Failed]"}, {"line": 139, "text": "  Backlog --> Cancelled[Cancelled]"}, {"line": 140, "text": "```"}, {"line": 141, "text": ""}, {"line": 142, "text": "最终结论由当前候选、冻结提交、运行结果和独立角色计算。`submitVerdict()` 不接受调用方直接制作的 Evidence 或 Verdict；Server 重新验证候选、事件身份、角色完整性和每项条件后才写入结论。Agent 的文本回复不是交付证据。最终结果使用 `winwincode.independent-verification-result.v1` 结构。"}, {"line": 143, "text": ""}, {"line": 144, "text": "### 执行图状态"}, {"line": 145, "text": ""}, {"line": 146, "text": "架构图和流程图贯穿三个公开状态："}, {"line": 147, "text": ""}, {"line": 148, "text": "| 状态 | 展示 | 内容边界 |"}, {"line": 149, "text": "| --- | --- | --- |"}, {"line": 150, "text": "| `before-execution` | 节点为绿色 | 只展示已审核的节点和关系 |"}, {"line": 151, "text": "| `executing` | 变化节点为浅蓝色 | 展示影响范围，不返回候选文件和原始日志 |"}, {"line": 152, "text": "| `execution-finished` | 变化节点为黄色 | 展示当前候选、Diff、运行活动和 Evidence 引用 |"}, {"line": 153, "text": ""}, {"line": 154, "text": "结束状态从明确的 base commit、candidate commit 和摘要重新计算，不使用执行中缓存的文件内容。"}, {"line": 155, "text": ""}, {"line": 156, "text": "## Provider、Credential 与外部副作用"}, {"line": 157, "text": ""}, {"line": 158, "text": "Provider Gateway 是 Control Plane 内部的唯一模型路由和长期 Credential 使用者。Worker 只通过 `execution-port-model-stream` 请求模型并接收流；请求中只带短期引用、路由和预算事实。Credential 服务保存受保护引用，公开合同和持久 Delivery 不保存原始密钥。"}, {"line": 159, "text": ""}, {"line": 160, "text": "Publication 先在 Control Plane 写入审批绑定、操作键和本地 receipt，再执行外部写入；重试通过同一操作键查询已存在的结果。Audit Ledger 保存主体、范围、操作、结果和摘要链，不复制命令正文、模型正文或凭据。"}, {"line": 161, "text": ""}, {"line": 162, "text": "## 本地与企业部署"}, {"line": 163, "text": ""}, {"line": 164, "text": "### 本地部署"}, {"line": 165, "text": ""}, {"line": 166, "text": "```text"}, {"line": 167, "text": "winwincode-local"}, {"line": 168, "text": "├─ winwincode-control-plane"}, {"line": 169, "text": "└─ winwincode-worker"}, {"line": 170, "text": "   ├─ winwincode-codex"}, {"line": 171, "text": "   ├─ winwincode-kernel"}, {"line": 172, "text": "   └─ winwincode-kernel-helper"}, {"line": 173, "text": "```"}, {"line": 174, "text": ""}, {"line": 175, "text": "[`winwincode-local`](../crates/winwincode-local/src/lib.rs) 只负责生命周期和组合。它通过注入的 Control Plane 端点和 `LocalWorkerAdapter` 传递 typed frame，并为每个进程生成独立数据根；SQLite、租约、收据和 outbox 的语义与企业部署相同。"}, {"line": 176, "text": ""}, {"line": 177, "text": "### 企业部署"}, {"line": 178, "text": ""}, {"line": 179, "text": "```text"}, {"line": 180, "text": "winwincode-server"}]}}, "roles": {"crates/winwincode-provider/src/device_model.rs": ["DeviceProviderStore.execute_model", "DeviceProviderStore.invoke_model", "provider_error_message"], "crates/winwincode-provider/src/device_store.rs": ["DeviceProviderStore.open", "DeviceProviderStore.snapshot", "DeviceProviderStore.decrypt_configuration", "DeviceProviderStore.mutate", "DeviceProviderStore.test_provider", "DeviceProviderStore.resolve", "new_secret_key", "adapter"], "crates/winwincode-provider/src/types.rs": ["ProviderGatewayOpenReceipt.stream_leak_gate", "ModelAttemptFailureFact.from_gateway", "ResolvedSecret.from_bytes", "<ResolvedSecret as fmt::Debug>.fmt", "SecretStoreError.missing", "SecretStoreError.version_conflict", "SecretStoreError.unavailable", "SecretStoreError.corrupt", "SecretStoreError.kind"]}}
